      ],
      "label": "User query",
      "value": "Design a pipeline that models the Trondheim Kommune compliance flow.\n\nPipeline requirements:\n- Source node: tk_request_intake\n- Task node: validate_request (check structure, metadata completeness)\n- Task node: retrieve_relevant_data (find datasets needed for the request)\n- Task node: process_data_for_compliance (prepare data for legal checks)\n- Task node: run_compliance_checks (sector law, DPIA, obligations)\n- Task node: prepare_sharing_decision (YES/NO decision support)\n- Destination node: tk_decision_output\n\nConnect nodes in a linear sequence.\nKeep the pipeline minimal and aligned with the compliance flow in the diagram.",
      "wasAttributedTo": "urn:inlumen:provenance:agent:operator"
    },
